  e9 [verified, public, as of 2026-06-04T00:00:00-05:00] This is Osei's only payment. No earlier payment is pending, and no new charge has been added to her account since 1 June 2026. (source: Student account record)
  e10 [verified, public, as of 2026-06-01T00:00:00-05:00] Once a financial hold is lifted, the registrar releases any queued transcript request within 4 working hours. The registrar's office works 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM Monday to Friday and does not work weekends. (source: Registrar service standard; registrar office hours)
  e11 [verified, public, as of 2026-06-01T00:00:00-05:00] The university, the bursar's office and the registrar's office are open and operating normally on every weekday from 1 June through 12 June 2026. No closure, furlough or holiday falls in that period, and the bursar's automated batch is unaffected by office staffing in any case. (source: University academic calendar; bursar's system operations schedule)
